From 8756d6b9a22c7052675aa703fd4921392183a615 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:23:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] Core+Items: MiningAccess Eldervale hooks, ore-only isle
 payouts, six isle skills
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Core MiningAccess grows quiet default methods (mirror of FarmAccess):
onMineIsle, oreFortuneBonus, orePowerBonus, oreSpeedPower,
oreHarvestBonus(+Label), noteOreHarvest, devAction/devItems/devStatus/devSpots.

Items:
- MineIsleHook: guarded calls (LinkageError -> hooks off once, logged).
- HarvestListener: isle Fortune on ore / mineral payouts only; ore-specific
  mastery Mining Power for the gate + speed of that ore; speed-only power
  (rhythm, rations) never touches gates; Rich Vein whole-item extras with a
  gold action-bar tag; Vein Siphon vacuum harvests reported to Mining.
- Six Mining skills: Bedrock Born (isle-only +16 Fortune +6 Spread),
  Work Song, Geode Nose, Union Card, Seam Reader, Depth Gauge — flavour
  lines, effect lines, isle gating in SkillService, loop hint.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
